7961979315_7505087733875023722_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RxC4DxEJS2sQ7kNvwG22H-p&_nc_oc=AdpKALRDynAR4kp5OpSkhvkmXsPsF0nN-Cd1RxIIKxFnaT0ZMQHg8zQriBeD8ZLCPnM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSZy3RfX78-yiwFRJY3sadOoMYO9aPR6ruOxHDKj_K_CQ&oe=6AFB2441"}, {"file_name": "dp_meta_performance_trends.png", "id": "1041554925574440", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303471_1041554928907773_4914293638558289651_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0rBiRgo7AtsQ7kNvwGpqkee&_nc_oc=AdoufRf_OdpI77rLv4DSsTzmPsA4VKaCuJB3N-rMoc96JZTGxQYFnmb_s6d4EiMUD9g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQclpyAOKarIbtXVaVaMU9a8N4wa9255wHCITmecflTGQ&oe=6AFB377B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "dream_putt_trailer_video_cover_image.png", "id": "2383960339079885", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308043_2383960345746551_4828014599960428775_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4K6MRN8w6x0Q7kNvwED0hIY&_nc_oc=Adq5d9H6KuK2h03JjFvgz2XzZb0sUz-Jg7bm7eDbkP7Ydl8IK6vO2d4ijH6ezs2hOjs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTDgYUaggxCQNfrj2cfuJri1HplEGD6wQtXvQhLltmFvA&oe=6AFB29EB"}, "display_name": "Dream Putt", "keywords": ["golf", "putting", "simulator", "putt", "putter"], "long_description": "# YOUR PORTABLE, INFINITE PUTTING STUDIO\n\nPutt with your real putter and ball on tour-level greens, anywhere indoors.\n\n100+ championship courses \u2014 every 2027 tour venue plus international and major venues \u2014 at full scale from real green topography data.\n{2191411091752523}\n# PRACTICE THE IMPOSSIBLE\n\n- Any pin, from anywhere on the green\n- Green speeds from 4\u201316\n- Custom hole sizes + ghost holes\n- Flagstick in or out\n- Wind at any speed and direction\n- Relive over 50 of golf's historic putts with Moments\n{28744232428520183}\n# ACCELERATE YOUR IMPROVEMENT\n\n- 1000+ drills: start line, distance control, green reading, mindset\n- Dynamic greens \u2014 any break on any slope\n- Randomized on-course scenarios\n{1434190562169726}\n# TRAINING AIDS\n\n- Alignment line\n- Tee gate\n- Customized putting arc\n- Animated stroke model\n- Metronome\n- Eyeline guide\n{1426051099495361}\n# READ GREENS YOUR WAY\n\n- Animated break grid\n- Slope measurements\n- Slope heatmap\n- Optimal line\n- Break zone and apex\n- Slope arrows\n{29721883677400919}\n# TRACK YOUR PROGRESS\n\n- Make rate\n- Miss tendencies\n- Strokes gained\n- Launch speed and angle\n- Performance trends and rating\n{958174776852402}\n# BUILT FOR META QUEST 3/3S\n\nMixed reality merges your room with championship greens \u2014 see your real putter and ball as you practice.\n\nNo launch monitor required! Just a real putter, a ball, and 16 sq ft of free space.\nFree demo; full access by subscription.\n\n**REAL PUTTS. REAL GREENS. REAL PRACTICE.**\n\nTerms: https://www.dreamputt.app/terms\n\nPrivacy: https://www.dreamputt.app/privacy\n", "short_description": "Turn any room into your own putting studio. Putt with your real putter and ball on 100+ championship courses \u2014 every 2027 tour venue plus international classics, built from real topography data.\n\nSet the stimp, hole size, pin, and wind. Sharpen up with 1000+ drills, training aids, green-reading overlays, and strokes gained analytics. Relive golf's historic putts from the legends' POV.\n\nNo launch monitor needed \u2014 just a putter, ball, and 16 sq ft of space.\n\nReal putts. Real greens. Real practice."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.dreamputt.app/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.dreamputt.app/terms", "publisher_name": "Jeffrey David Golf, LLC", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/dPS8AW6e7M", "website_url": "https://www.dreamputt.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "C